# Magic tablets
Soft clay plus runes into teleport tablets.

```table
Method                            Cost  Profit     ROI
--------------------------------  ----  ------  ------
Make Varrock teleport (tablet)     280     312  111.4%
Make Teleport to house (tablet)    268     310  115.7%
Make Lumbridge teleport (tablet)   280     300  107.1%
Make Falador teleport (tablet)     280     260   92.9%
Make Camelot teleport (tablet)     287     117   40.8%
Make Ardougne teleport (tablet)    393      27    6.9%
```
=> /ge/calc-tablet/tab-varrock Make Varrock teleport (tablet)
=> /ge/calc-tablet/tab-house Make Teleport to house (tablet)
=> /ge/calc-tablet/tab-lumbridge Make Lumbridge teleport (tablet)
=> /ge/calc-tablet/tab-falador Make Falador teleport (tablet)
=> /ge/calc-tablet/tab-camelot Make Camelot teleport (tablet)
=> /ge/calc-tablet/tab-ardougne Make Ardougne teleport (tablet)

## Notes
* gp/hour uses a typical action rate for the method and assumes you never wait on a buy offer. Treat it as an upper bound.
* Rows marked "no price" reference an item nobody has traded recently, so no profit can be computed for them honestly.

=> https://grandexchange.dreamstation.systems/calc/tablet This page on the web
